# Provisional Third-Party Notices

This unpublished development artifact bundles the Racket CS @RACKET_VERSION@
runtime and Racket modules selected by `raco exe` and `raco distribute`.

The following sections reproduce the exact top-level license notice and license
texts from the pinned Racket @RACKET_VERSION@ build toolchain. Their SHA-256
digests are recorded beside each section. This is a provisional runtime notice,
not the final package-by-package legal inventory required by Phase 27.
